   "date_or_version": "Final Cut Pro 12.4, macOS 26.6; fetched 2026-10-28. Canonical: https://support.apple.com/guide/final-cut-pro/keyboard-shortcuts-ver90ba5929/mac. One page with tables Application, Editing, Effects, General, Marking, Organization, Playback and navigation, Share and tools, View, Windows."
