  "delete_clip": {
   "keys": [
    "Delete"
   ],
   "why": "The page documents only the Mac Delete key (Backspace here) and says nothing of Forward Delete; on a Windows or Linux keyboard Delete is the key that removes a clip, so Klipp's own Delete stays on it (#2969)."
  }
